        "text": "The core pattern is **Trees**. We can optimize memory by reusing leaf nodes. Since all leaves with value `true` are identical and all leaves with value `false` are identical, we can create just two singleton leaf nodes and reuse them throughout the tree instead of creating new leaf nodes each time."
