        "text": "The core pattern is **Advanced Graphs**. After building one MST, edges not in the MST create cycles when added. We use `DFS` to find the path in the MST between the endpoints of each non-MST edge. If any edge on this path has the same weight as the non-MST edge, both edges are pseudo-critical (they can be swapped). MST edges not identified as pseudo-critical are critical."
